<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat Australia by six wickets on the third day of the third test at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 219 (Greg Blewett 62, Curtly Ambrose five for 55) and 122 (Curtly Ambrose four for 17); West Indies 255 (Jimmy Adams 74 not out, Glenn McGrath five for 50) and 87 for four.</p>
</text>
